#: crashreportdialog.cpp:21
msgid "Crash Reporting"
msgstr "Foutverslaggewing"

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:27
msgid ""
"This is a diagnostic build of Avogadro. It can send a report to the "
"developers when Avogadro crashes, which helps us fix crashes we cannot "
"reproduce ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie is 'n diagnostiese weergawe van Avogadro. Dit kan 'n verslag aan die "
"ontwikkelaars stuur wanneer Avogadro ineenstort; dit help ons om "
"ineenstortings reg te stel wat ons nie self kan herskep nie."

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:38
msgid ""
"A crash report contains a snapshot of Avogadro's memory at the moment it "
"failed, along with your operating system, graphics driver and Avogadro "
"version, and a log of recent activity. That memory snapshot makes the report "
"useful, but it may incidentally include fragments of what you were working "
"on, such as part of a file name or a molecule you had open."
msgstr ""
"'n Instortingsverslag bevat 'n momentopname van Avogadro se geheue op die "
"oomblik dat dit gefaal het, tesame met inligting oor jou bedryfstelsel, "
"grafika-bestuurder en Avogadro-weergawe, asook 'n logboek van onlangse "
"aktiwiteite. Daardie geheue-momentopname maak die verslag nuttig, maar dit "
"kan moontlik fragmente insluit van dit waaraan jy gewerk het – soos 'n deel "
"van 'n lêernaam of 'n molekule wat jy oop gehad het."

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:52
msgid ""
"Nothing is sent unless you agree. You can change this at any time under Help "
"→ Crash Reporting."
msgstr ""
"Niks word gestuur tensy jy instem nie. Jy kan dit te eniger tyd verander "
"onder Hulp → Foutverslaggewing."

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:63
msgid "Send Crash Reports"
msgstr "Dien foutverslag in"

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:64
msgid "Don't Send"
msgstr "Moenie stuur"

#: crashreportdialog.cpp:67
msgid "Send crash reports to the Avogadro developers"
msgstr "Stuur ineenstortingsverslae aan die Avogadro-ontwikkelaars"

